 det="Our showroom and workshop are in Peterborough, around 20 miles from Huntingdon. As well as Huntingdon itself, we design and fit in Godmanchester, Brampton, Hartford and the Hemingfords. We cover homes up to 80 miles from Peterborough, so if you're further out, <a href=\"tel:01733686767\">call 01733 686767</a> and we'll tell you straight away.",
